    "sections": {
        "description": "The AI Enterprise theme is designed for technology companies, SaaS platforms, and startups focused on artificial intelligence and digital solutions. It includes structured layouts for service details, product showcases, team profiles, pricing sections, testimonials, and contact information. The responsive design ensures smooth functionality across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. Customization options allow adjustments to typography, colors, banners, and page layouts while maintaining a modern and organized appearance. The theme also supports blog sections, image galleries, and call-to-action areas for presenting AI tools and business services clearly. Suitable for an AI data science company, digital AI agency, chatbot platform, machine learning service, or AI image generator project, the layout provides a professional framework for showcasing artificial intelligence technologies, AI models, automation services, and startup solutions in a structured and accessible format."
    },
